  "narrative": "The attack we analyzed is multi-stage, an initial dropper malware written in Delphi programming language (a language used by the [REDACTED_MALWARE] in other campaigns) downloads a second stage payload from internet and executes it. Script The communication with the command and control is managed with a script written in the AutoIt language. This malware is particularly interesting for us because it contacts a command and control with the name “marina-info.net” a clear reference to the Italian Military corp, Marina Militare.",
